<title>CHINA: CHINA COPPER DEMAND SEEN AT 1.73 MLN TONNES BY 201.</title>
<headline>CHINA COPPER DEMAND SEEN AT 1.73 MLN TONNES BY 201.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's annual demand for copper is expected to reach 1.73 million tonnes by the year 2010 and 2.04 million tonnes by the year 2020, the China Daily Business Weekly said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The newspaper was quoting figures provided by the Ministry of Geology and Mineral Resources.</p>
<p>China is estimated to produce about 1.05 million tonnes of copper in 1997 and to consumer 1.3 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
